--- what a residency threshold would cost, per axis ---
  DESIGN.md  grants residency on a known band with three residents, and
  Bond.trust and Bond.warmth are the two exemptions that expire at session 09.
  The in-game day the THIRD resident crossed each mark:
    mark          20      40      60      80     100
    warmth     never   never   never   never   never
    trust         28      54      80   never   never
  'never' means no three residents reached it in 100 days at this model.

--- how far one deed travels, and how well it survives the telling ---
  one deed, emitted on day 0 in a settlement of 9, then nobody visits.
  a retelling keeps 70% of the teller's confidence; below 50 nobody can name the actor.

  witnesses / gossip       day 0   day 1   day 2 of village   unnamed
  0% seen it, told             5       5       5       56%         0
  35% seen it, told            6       6       6       67%         0
  100% seen it, told           9       9       9      100%         0
  35% seen it, silent          4       4       4       44%         0

  'unnamed' is holders who cannot say who did it, at the close of day 2.
  the silent row is the control: with step 7 off, a deed reaches the people who
  were standing there and stops. That is what this session exists to end.

  every copy the village holds, by confidence:
    100  names the actor            4 holder(s)
     70  names the actor            2 holder(s)
  a fourth row here would mean the two-hop bound has moved. Nothing counts hops:
  it falls out of the retention and the attribution floor, and GossipTest says so.

--- does gossip make the residency threshold reachable? ---
  session 07: a witness's share of a gift is one point and warmth decays one a
  day, so no three residents ever reach 20 warmth. Gossip gives more villagers
  more contact days, and contact days are what stop the decay. Same plan, twice:
  the in-game day the THIRD resident crossed each mark.
    axis     gossip        20      40      60      80     100
    warmth   off       never   never   never   never   never
    trust    off          29      60      89   never   never
    warmth   on        never   never   never   never   never
    trust    on           28      54      80   never   never
  'never' means no three residents reached it in 100 days.

